/* ------------------------------------------------------------------
   Ullmhú Scrúdaithe IRS139 — vocabulary data
   ------------------------------------------------------------------
   One object per entry:
     ga    Irish (required)
     en    English (required)
     cat   category key — see CATS (required)
     note  bitesize grammar point, etymology or anecdote (optional)
     see   related Irish headwords, shown as tappable chips
     noq   true = leave out of the typed quiz (too long / no single answer)
     src   "lst" = your vocab list, "s2" = Seachtain 2 sheet

   To add a week: append objects to VOCAB. Counts, filters, decks,
   drills and progress all rebuild themselves from this array.
   ------------------------------------------------------------------ */

